{"type":"text","timestamp":1794380710308,"sessionID":"ses_e36a1605fffeQa463ZF52q8gD3","part":{"id":"prt_1c96cc1930010NVI8qsemxqt8z","messageID":"msg_1c96cb36d0014tqhZlL55TkhAt","sessionID":"ses_e36a1605fffeQa463ZF52q8gD3","type":"text","text":"<think>Now remove the unused ROUND_HALF_UP import and update DEFAULT_PAGE_SIZE to 50. Also fix the frontend static serving to handle missing dist gracefully (dev mode).\n\nAlso, the `frontend` catch-all: `send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")` will 404 if the dist doesn't exist. In dev, the Vite dev server proxies /api to the Flask app, so the catch-all only matters in production. But for smoke testing without a build, I should handle it: if index.html missing → return a simple message. Let me make it robust.\n\nAlso, the catch-all route `@app.get(\"/<path:path>\")` — a request to \"/api/unknown\" returns JSON 404 ✓.\n\nOne more issue: HEAD requests to static files. send_from_directory handles HEAD ✓.\n\nLet me also add a favicon route? Not needed.\n\nLet me update the imports and pagesize.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794380710291,"end":1794380710305}}}
