{"type":"text","timestamp":1794380731150,"sessionID":"ses_e36a1605fffeQa463ZF52q8gD3","part":{"id":"prt_1c96d12f90015xhht6vt5cbit2","messageID":"msg_1c96d07bd001bIrKBQhIGYT4js","sessionID":"ses_e36a1605fffeQa463ZF52q8gD3","type":"text","text":"<think>Hmm, still rejected. Perhaps the issue is writing to /tmp/opencode/app.log with `>`? /tmp/opencode/* is allowed for reading external directory... Maybe the write redirect is treated differently. Let me try writing the log into /workspace/.run/app.log instead.\n\nAlso maybe backgrounding is the problem. Let me test with a simple approach first.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794380731129,"end":1794380731146}}}
