ogin                    -> 200\nPASS GET    /api/admin/products                -> 200\n   admin sees 10 products\nPASS POST   /api/admin/products                -> 201\n   created: {\"description\": \"temp\", \"id\": 11, \"is_active\": true, \"name\": \"Test Widget\", \"price\": 12.345, \"stock\": 5}\nPASS PATCH  /api/admin/products/11             -> 200\nPASS PATCH  /api/admin/products/11             -> 400\nPASS PATCH  /api/admin/products/11             -> 400\nPASS PATCH  /api/admin/products/999999         -> 404\n--- inactive handling\nPASS POST   /api/cart                          -> 200\nPASS PATCH  /api/admin/products/11             -> 200\nPASS GET    /api/cart                          -> 200\n   subtotal after deactivation: 72.5\nPASS GET    /api/products?q=Test               -> 200\nPASS GET    /api/products/11                   -> 404\nPASS POST   /api/cart                          -> 404\n--- delete cart item\nPASS GET    /api/cart                          -> 200\nPASS DELETE /api/cart/1                        -> 200\nPASS DELETE /api/cart/1                        -> 404\n--- cleanup\nFAIL DELETE /api/admin/products/11             -> 405\n\nFAILURES:\n - GET /api/auth/me expected 401 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - GET /api/auth/me expected 401 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - GET /api/cart expected 401 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - GET /api/admin/products expected 403 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - GET /api/admin/products expected 401 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - POST /api/admin/products expected 403 got 500: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>500 Internal Server Error</title>\n<h1>Internal Server Error</h1>\n<p>The server encountered an internal error and was unable to complete your request. Either the server is overloaded or there is an error in the application.</p>\n\n - DELETE /api/admin/products/11 expected 404 got 405: <!doctype html>\n<html lang=en>\n<title>405 Method Not Allowed</title>\n<h1>Method Not Allowed</h1>\n<p>The method is not allowed for the requested URL.</p>\n\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && python3 .run/smoke.py 2>&1 | tail -70","time":{"start":1794380904095,"end":1794380904908}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c96fb698001h4q3n6q41AwCmt","sessionID":"ses_e36a1605fffeQa463ZF52q8gD3","messageID":"msg_1c96faf81001zJykGwS77BG0Tk"}}
